Scope

This license covers ONLY the original recompilation code, tooling, and runtime
in this repository, including the vendored pcrecomp snapshot under
tools/pcrecomp/ (itself MIT).

It does NOT cover the game "Recoil" or any of its data. Recoil is Copyright (c)
1999 Zipper Interactive and Virgin Interactive Entertainment. No original game
executables, DLLs, disc images, or other game assets are included in this
repository.

It also does NOT cover the lifted C that run_pipeline.py produces
(src/recomp/gen/). That output is a derivative work of the original executable,
carries whatever license the original does, and is generated from your own copy
rather than distributed here. You must supply your own legally obtained copy of
the game to build and run this project.
